////pretty small random number genarator
////the index for random is 0x09 so thats why i chose 9
//// so we can use 1 byte for the max value and for the random math call
//// we chose zero because it doesnt add a byte because its default value
//
////we manually declare these so they arent const
//// which wouldve added a single byte
////if we run in release mode we get 17 bytes for this entire program
////for reference all the opcodes are combined 16 bytes
//// (push, push, math, exit)
////thats without data or header so 17 bytes is pretty good
